#HELPS
1 ABAELUN DIAMOND MINE~
Abaelun Mine is Vvardenfell's single active diamond mine, northeast of Caldera
where Imperial guards watch Dunmer miners cutting through its winding tunnels.
The Imperial and Hlaalu venture draws rare gems from seams hidden behind stone
while little else of value lies within the guarded workings.~
